    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, you said \"the benefit of preemptive advocacy often outweighs the risk of perceived inaction\". that sounds like you're saying we should definitely take a side. are you saying that from a pure business strategy standpoint, being \"neutral\" is basically a losing move now? like, is it even a viable option anymore?",
