    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay, but if we do that \"carefully worded\" thing, aren't we just being dishonest? if we don't actually say \"we support the tax,\" the activists are still gonna call us out for being fake. basically, is there any way to stay neutral without looking like we're just trying to hide something? or is supporting the mandate basically just the only way to stay \"reputable\" in today's market?",
