      "content": "It is nearly impossible to be completely neutral without *some* interpretation by critics, as silence is often framed as agreement with the status quo. A carefully worded statement can pivot away from a binary \"support/oppose\" stance by highlighting your internal commitments to sustainability beyond the tax. However, if the mandate is viewed as the industry \"correct\" move, then demonstrating active alignment with those values is the fastest way to re-establish reputational credibility. In today's environment, visible action usually trumps ambiguous positioning.",
